# Copy to .githooks/private-terms.local (git-ignored) and add one regex per line.
# Use it for employer names, client names, internal system names, real names —
# anything that must never appear in a public commit. Lines starting with # are
# ignored. Matching is case-insensitive.
#
# examples:
# my-employer-name
# internal-project-codename
# some ?client ?system
